*{{cite interview|last=Turner|first=Alex|subject-link=Alex Turner|interviewer=John Kennedy|title=Tranquility Base Hotel & Casino: Alex Turner's Definitive Guide|url=https://www.radiox.co.uk/artists/arctic-monkeys/arctic-monkeys-tranquility-base-hotel-casino-album|publisher=[[Radio X (United Kingdom)|Radio X]]|location=London|date=17 May 2018|work=X-Posure|access-date=28 June 2018|archive-date=12 June 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180612141357/https://www.radiox.co.uk/artists/arctic-monkeys/arctic-monkeys-tranquility-base-hotel-casino-album/|url-status=live}}
